    "### Q8. Conceptual, no code needed. Titanic is ~38% positive — mildly imbalanced. If instead\n",
    "it were **0.5%** positive (say, fraud), which of accuracy / ROC-AUC / PR-AUC would\n",
    "you report, and why?\n",
    "\n",
    "<details><summary>hint</summary>\n",
